  m_text: The Hoshi-mato  is also refered to as "Star Target". The targets are only
    36cm in width. There are no rules regarding the choice of targets outside the
    official Kyudo tests, but most Kyudojos reserve the Hoshi-mato for special training
    sessions. This target is specified as a "Bad Target" in this game and will result
    in point deduction if hit.
