  _labelText: ' Kasumi-Mato (Good Target)'
  _infoText: The Kasumi-mato is also refered to as "Mist Target".The targets are
    only 36cm in width. This is the standard target in official Kyudo tests. There
    are no rules regarding the choice of targets outside these tests, but most Kyudojos
    reserve the Kasumi-mato for daily training sessions. This target is specified
    as a "Good Target" in this game and will result in point increase if hit.
